# Build output for the fixtures in this directory.
#
# Scoped here rather than added at the repository root on purpose: the flagship fixture at the
# root commits its own bin/ and obj/, and changing that is a separate decision with its own
# consequences for whatever reads those bytes. This only governs examples/.
#
# packages.lock.json is NOT ignored and must stay committed - OSV-Scanner reads it, and without
# it the dependency layer of every chain in here goes undetected.
bin/
obj/
